Condorcet with Dual Dropping Perl script

http://condorcet-dd.sourceforge.net/
http://sourceforge.net/projects/condorcet-dd/
http://freshmeat.net/projects/condorcet_dd/?topic_id=234

A vote tabulation and ranking system for deciding single or multi-winner contests (elections) using preference or approval ballots. Dual Dropping will compute the Schwartz Sequential Dropping (SSD) and Tideman's Ranked Pair (RP) results for each contest round and select the combined SSD and RP contest outcome with the lowest overall dropping cost. It has options to compute just the SSD or RP outcome, various optional tie-breakers, and alternative measures of defeat and dropping cost (winning votes and/or margin).  See documentation on SourceForge.

Available in RPM package or tar.gz formats and zip format for Microsoft Windows (with setup.exe install wizard). 




